{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_011Cg2ghHDaNLWMnXZK5B7LG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All tests pass. Here's what was fixed in `storage/storage.go`:\n\n- **CAS semantics**: revision 0 creates a missing key (errors if key exists); revision > 0 requires an exact match on current revision and increments it on success.\n- **Atomic validation**: empty keys and negative revisions are rejected before acquiring the lock; stale revision checks happen atomically inside the lock.\n- **No aliasing**: `Snapshot()` returns a fresh copy of the map, so callers (including `replica.Copy` and `export.JSON`) cannot mutate internal storage.\n- **Concurrent safety**: a `sync.Mutex` guards all reads and writes to `data`, ensuring the concurrent test's 20 goroutines produce exactly revision 1."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":83,"cache_read_input_tokens":19644,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":83},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9e1c96bc-fe3d-488a-9e1b-c886a7184df1","uuid":"7972a1ec-01ed-41bb-af19-16c2db25c937"}
